  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はぁ……はぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織……？\r\nこんな時間までお疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサー……\r\nお疲れ様です",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この前、苦手だって言ってたステップの練習をしていたのか",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\nまだ、少し不安があったので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nでも今日はもう遅いし、帰らないと",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……まだ時間はあります",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やる気があるのはいいことだけど\r\n体を壊したら元も子もないぞ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "休むことだってアイドルの仕事なんだからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……わかりました",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし。それじゃあもう夜も遅いし、送っていくよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい。ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
