      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、必要なことですから",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサーこそ\r\nそんな時間まで働いて疲れてないんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これくらい、全然大したことないよ\r\n仕事が楽しいっていうのもあるけどな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "楽しい……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n……どうした？　そんな不思議そうな顔をして",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、いえ……\r\n仕事が楽しい、というのがよくわからなかったので……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、たしかに楽しいことばかりってわけじゃないけど\r\n俺の仕事は……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "灯織のためだからな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "自分で決めた\r\nことだからな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "やりがいのある\r\n仕事だからな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私のため、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。俺が仕事を頑張ったら\r\nその分、灯織の結果につながるんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから楽しく思えるし、\r\nやめたいとは思わないんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そう、なんですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "じゃあ、私も期待に応えられるように\r\nしないといけませんね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "期待してるぞ、灯織\r\n明日も頑張ろうな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、明日もよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020140"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "上手くいかない時もあるけど\r\n中途半端にはできないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真剣になれるから楽しい……\r\nって言ったらいいのかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……その気持ち、\r\n私にも少しわかるかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "中途半端が、１番嫌ですから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……灯織はいつだって真剣だもんな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "当然です\r\n……私も、自分で決めたことですから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020170"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頑張れば頑張るほど返ってくる\r\nすごく楽しいよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……前まではわかりませんでしたが、\r\n最近は、ちょっとわかります",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……それはすごくいいことだな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……どうしてそんなに嬉しそうなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200402/2002004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織が仕事を楽しんでくれてるのがわかったから\r\nすごく嬉しかったんだよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……それは、よくわからないです",
